\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Remark}
\title{How we formulate evaluation utility}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{evaluation}

\p{Sutton and Barto define scalar episodic return in
\citet{Section 3.3}{sutton2018reinforcement}. Benchmarks also use exact-match,
test, latency, safety, and cost measurements. We formulate a seeded vector
utility so those coordinates can remain separate and evaluator randomness is
part of the declared law.}

\p{The vector is not a claim that its coordinates share a natural scale.
Scalarization, Pareto order, and worst-group summaries are introduced only
after the attainable evaluation set is defined.}
